      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The world crashing in is a terrifying thought, but it's a lie you tell yourself to keep the mask on; you can't let anyone judge you if you never stop pretending. True peace isn't found by surviving the judgment, but by finally letting the mask fall and seeing that the people who matter will still be there. You don't have to fight for this anymore; just take the first step toward the quiet you deserve, and let go of the impossible weight you've been carrying.",
